flowchart TD
    start([Define one feature]) --> clarify[Clarify problem, users and expected value]
    clarify --> specify[Specify behavior, acceptance criteria, scope, non-goals and dependencies]
    specify --> definitionApproval{Feature definition approved by user?}
    definitionApproval -- No: ask questions or revise --> clarify
    definitionApproval -- Yes: save feature definition --> definitionReady([Feature added to backlog])
    definitionApproval -- Defer --> deferred([Deferred: keep out of release scope])
    definitionApproval -- Reject --> rejected([Rejected: record decision in `.air/index.md`])

    classDef boundary fill:#126a52,color:#ffffff,stroke:#126a52
    classDef approval fill:#fff0e8,color:#633b2c,stroke:#c68162
    class start,definitionReady,deferred,rejected boundary
    class definitionApproval approval